  "title": "Mom&#39;s Breakfast Strata",
  "description": "This savory bread pudding combines grated Cheddar cheese, cubed ham, mushrooms, green peppers, and onions for a great make-ahead breakfast treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Amy Schmelzer"
  ],
